{"id":154516479,"slug":"fires-in-los-angeles","title":"Fires in Los Angeles","subtitle":"Radical acceptance of what is happening ","post_date":"2025-01-10T07:31:17.860Z","audience":"everyone","type":"newsletter","canonical_url":"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/fires-in-los-angeles","wordcount":437,"source":"api","fetched_at":"2026-09-13T21:49:34.837Z","body_sha256":"be6d3fe5fd2561fd1ca88a3c727df213968989b8bafc1037df3486d0def5d58c","text_words":447,"complete":true,"body_html":"<p>Welcome to the Frontier Psychiatrist newsletter. Today, a meditation on current events and ancient events, both.</p><p>Fire is primal.  It's a<a href=\"https://www.nytimes.com/2024/11/29/podcasts/hardfork-iconic-100-technologies.html\"> leading iconic technology </a>if you consider the NY Times an authority.  Watching Los Angeles burn doesn't feel good.  It feels even less good to have everything you love burned as you run as fast as possible, hoping it won't engulf you, too.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jbXM!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F36c11118-9fa2-429d-8a54-c7d640179906_1290x739.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jbXM!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F36c11118-9fa2-429d-8a54-c7d640179906_1290x739.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jbXM!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F36c11118-9fa2-429d-8a54-c7d640179906_1290x739.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jbXM!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F36c11118-9fa2-429d-8a54-c7d640179906_1290x739.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jbXM!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F36c11118-9fa2-429d-8a54-c7d640179906_1290x739.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jbXM!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F36c11118-9fa2-429d-8a54-c7d640179906_1290x739.jpeg\" width=\"637\" height=\"364.9170542635659\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/36c11118-9fa2-429d-8a54-c7d640179906_1290x739.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:739,&quot;width&quot;:1290,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:637,&quot;bytes&quot;:495987,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jbXM!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F36c11118-9fa2-429d-8a54-c7d640179906_1290x739.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jbXM!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F36c11118-9fa2-429d-8a54-c7d640179906_1290x739.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jbXM!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F36c11118-9fa2-429d-8a54-c7d640179906_1290x739.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jbXM!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F36c11118-9fa2-429d-8a54-c7d640179906_1290x739.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">A screen capture of media footage of an LA MacDonalds.</figcaption></figure></div><p>It's also worth remembering that fire has been around for longer than we have. I've <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/pub/thefrontierpsychiatrists/p/fire-has-product-market-fit-that?r=1ct8f&amp;utm_campaign=post&amp;utm_medium=web&amp;showWelcomeOnShare=false\">written about fire</a> before. It's easy to take it for granted. It's easy to think about a wood-burning fireplace—it it makes a living room cozy! Or having that gas range—that's a high-end appliance. Let's see that other option for a high-end kitchen…</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MX_z!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Feade04be-2711-4c1f-95b3-ae001f2303e9_1920x1280.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MX_z!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Feade04be-2711-4c1f-95b3-ae001f2303e9_1920x1280.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MX_z!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Feade04be-2711-4c1f-95b3-ae001f2303e9_1920x1280.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MX_z!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Feade04be-2711-4c1f-95b3-ae001f2303e9_1920x1280.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MX_z!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Feade04be-2711-4c1f-95b3-ae001f2303e9_1920x1280.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MX_z!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Feade04be-2711-4c1f-95b3-ae001f2303e9_1920x1280.jpeg\" width=\"1456\" height=\"971\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/eade04be-2711-4c1f-95b3-ae001f2303e9_1920x1280.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:971,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:763114,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MX_z!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Feade04be-2711-4c1f-95b3-ae001f2303e9_1920x1280.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MX_z!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Feade04be-2711-4c1f-95b3-ae001f2303e9_1920x1280.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MX_z!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Feade04be-2711-4c1f-95b3-ae001f2303e9_1920x1280.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MX_z!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Feade04be-2711-4c1f-95b3-ae001f2303e9_1920x1280.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>When it comes to pure science facts, fire is a combustion reaction. The combination of carbon, oxygen, and heat creates water vapor, carbon dioxide, ash, and more heat and light.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!HpbM!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe864c56e-1277-441c-87b7-773d9c051f47_1290x231.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!HpbM!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe864c56e-1277-441c-87b7-773d9c051f47_1290x231.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!HpbM!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe864c56e-1277-441c-87b7-773d9c051f47_1290x231.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!HpbM!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe864c56e-1277-441c-87b7-773d9c051f47_1290x231.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!HpbM!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe864c56e-1277-441c-87b7-773d9c051f47_1290x231.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!HpbM!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe864c56e-1277-441c-87b7-773d9c051f47_1290x231.jpeg\" width=\"1290\" height=\"231\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/e864c56e-1277-441c-87b7-773d9c051f47_1290x231.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:231,&quot;width&quot;:1290,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:61716,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!HpbM!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe864c56e-1277-441c-87b7-773d9c051f47_1290x231.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!HpbM!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe864c56e-1277-441c-87b7-773d9c051f47_1290x231.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!HpbM!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe864c56e-1277-441c-87b7-773d9c051f47_1290x231.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!HpbM!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe864c56e-1277-441c-87b7-773d9c051f47_1290x231.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"></picture><div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Everything we know—the water that makes up Rain itself—was forged in fires, ancient.  The ability to have those pine trees make new pine trees?  It doesn’t work without a fire to burn the whole goddamn forest down.  The pinecones aren't opening until there's enough heat.</p><p>Similarly, conditions must be perfect for a fire to blaze out of control, and conditions need to be right to extinguish it. Some of these conditions are beyond our control.   Humans have tamed many forces in the natural world; it's easy to imagine we will continue to do so.  Los Angeles proves that not all forces are within our control.  Some of them?  They are existentially, terrifyingly, abruptly, and horrifyingly beyond anything we tiny little humans can turn the dial on.</p><p>Our conceptualizations hinge on factors bigger than us, too.  Time frame matters—did we have time to run?  The size of the fuel supply matters. Our control over a thing burning matters…to us. Fire doesn't care about any of this. It's gonna do what it does, and if it burns us alive, that's just  what we get for being heretics who believed we could control it and not that it would exert its relentless power over us.</p><p>Our modern world is an homage to the impossible dream of harnessing fire and not letting fire own our nightmares in return.</p><iframe class=\"spotify-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;image&quot;:&quot;https://i.scdn.co/image/ab67616d0000b2735026db4c201719ff4b0bc1d4&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Grapevine Fires&quot;,&quot;subtitle&quot;:&quot;Death Cab for Cutie&quot;,&quot;description&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://open.spotify.com/track/1x3bxSSANgIxkoyGldhmdX&quot;,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;noScroll&quot;:false}\" src=\"https://open.spotify.com/embed/track/1x3bxSSANgIxkoyGldhmdX\" frameborder=\"0\" gesture=\"media\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" allow=\"encrypted-media\" loading=\"lazy\" data-component-name=\"Spotify2ToDOM\"></iframe><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!u9ak!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3f43c7d3-e23d-4e96-8182-c34673c20f68_2000x1500.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!u9ak!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3f43c7d3-e23d-4e96-8182-c34673c20f68_2000x1500.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!u9ak!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3f43c7d3-e23d-4e96-8182-c34673c20f68_2000x1500.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!u9ak!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3f43c7d3-e23d-4e96-8182-c34673c20f68_2000x1500.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!u9ak!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3f43c7d3-e23d-4e96-8182-c34673c20f68_2000x1500.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!u9ak!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3f43c7d3-e23d-4e96-8182-c34673c20f68_2000x1500.jpeg\" width=\"490\" height=\"367.5\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/3f43c7d3-e23d-4e96-8182-c34673c20f68_2000x1500.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1092,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:490,&quot;bytes&quot;:467675,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!u9ak!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3f43c7d3-e23d-4e96-8182-c34673c20f68_2000x1500.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!u9ak!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3f43c7d3-e23d-4e96-8182-c34673c20f68_2000x1500.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!u9ak!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3f43c7d3-e23d-4e96-8182-c34673c20f68_2000x1500.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!u9ak!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3f43c7d3-e23d-4e96-8182-c34673c20f68_2000x1500.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">LA from a plane in the air.</figcaption></figure></div><p>My prayers go out to my friends in Los Angeles and to anywhere else in the world that did burn before or might in the future.  We need to be careful, lest we are treated by the gods as heretics, all.</p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><iframe class=\"spotify-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;image&quot;:&quot;https://i.scdn.co/image/ab67616d0000b273114cba2e500ca62f26fe343e&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Catastrophe&quot;,&quot;subtitle&quot;:&quot;Owen Muir&quot;,&quot;description&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://open.spotify.com/track/2wpt2sCOg3CpLpxgMfBokd&quot;,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;noScroll&quot;:false}\" src=\"https://open.spotify.com/embed/track/2wpt2sCOg3CpLpxgMfBokd\" frameborder=\"0\" gesture=\"media\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" allow=\"encrypted-media\" loading=\"lazy\" data-component-name=\"Spotify2ToDOM\"></iframe><p>To quote a second emo band in two days, <em>catastrophe keeps us together.  </em></p>","text":"Welcome to the Frontier Psychiatrist newsletter. Today, a meditation on current events and ancient events, both.\n\nFire is primal. It's a leading iconic technology if you consider the NY Times an authority. Watching Los Angeles burn doesn't feel good. It feels even less good to have everything you love burned as you run as fast as possible, hoping it won't engulf you, too.\n\nA screen capture of media footage of an LA MacDonalds.\n\nIt's also worth remembering that fire has been around for longer than we have. I've written about fire before. It's easy to take it for granted. It's easy to think about a wood-burning fireplace—it it makes a living room cozy! Or having that gas range—that's a high-end appliance. Let's see that other option for a high-end kitchen…\n\nWhen it comes to pure science facts, fire is a combustion reaction. The combination of carbon, oxygen, and heat creates water vapor, carbon dioxide, ash, and more heat and light.\n\nEverything we know—the water that makes up Rain itself—was forged in fires, ancient. The ability to have those pine trees make new pine trees? It doesn’t work without a fire to burn the whole goddamn forest down. The pinecones aren't opening until there's enough heat.\n\nSimilarly, conditions must be perfect for a fire to blaze out of control, and conditions need to be right to extinguish it. Some of these conditions are beyond our control. Humans have tamed many forces in the natural world; it's easy to imagine we will continue to do so. Los Angeles proves that not all forces are within our control. Some of them? They are existentially, terrifyingly, abruptly, and horrifyingly beyond anything we tiny little humans can turn the dial on.\n\nOur conceptualizations hinge on factors bigger than us, too. Time frame matters—did we have time to run? The size of the fuel supply matters. Our control over a thing burning matters…to us. Fire doesn't care about any of this. It's gonna do what it does, and if it burns us alive, that's just what we get for being heretics who believed we could control it and not that it would exert its relentless power over us.\n\nOur modern world is an homage to the impossible dream of harnessing fire and not letting fire own our nightmares in return.\n\nLA from a plane in the air.\n\nMy prayers go out to my friends in Los Angeles and to anywhere else in the world that did burn before or might in the future. We need to be careful, lest we are treated by the gods as heretics, all.\n\nSubscribe now\n\nTo quote a second emo band in two days, catastrophe keeps us together."}